          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Accompanying you across countless battlefields has allowed your companion to unleash its full potential. The companion you gained with @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Commander's Companion] is now a nimble or savage animal companion.</p>\n<p>Your animal companion is more readily responsive to your will. During an encounter, even if you don't use the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Command an Animal] action, your animal companion can still use 1 action that round on your turn to Stride or Strike. If it does, it also gains a reaction it can use to respond to your tactics, but that's all the actions it gets that round—you can't Command it later.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Battle-Tested Companion"
              }
            ]
